      "name": "ck-moe-blockscale-mfma32-remap",
      "description": "Remap a CK block-scale MoE grouped GEMM pipeline to 32x32 MFMA (+CShuffle epilogue, +A-LDS pad): 1.47x isolated, all three token cases",
